      "banked": 10,
      "cause_measured": "The banked claims-channel spike control is a function of which ten of the fourteen DANN groups the dict happens to enumerate first, because the injected unit is each group's lexicographically smallest claim and some of those are shorter than the gate's n-gram order, so they cannot hit under any correct gate. It is the CONTROL that is order-dependent, not the gate: with injected units that carry at least one n-gram the gate detects every one of them. The evidence-channel spike reproduces 10/10 because window units are long.",
