        "detected_total": 10,
        "baseline_hits": 0,
        "passes": true,
        "candidate_units": 2000,
        "construction": "one unit per bucket, taking the first sorted claim that carries at least one n-gram at n=8 instead of the first sorted claim outright"
      },
      "consequence": "the CONTROL is order-dependent, not the gate: fed injected units that carry at least one n-gram the gate detects 10 of 10 with 0 baseline hits. The audit's clean claims-channel number is unaffected; what does not reproduce is that channel's spike control, whose banked 10/10 was one of two values the shipped construction can return on this mix",
